<title>UK: REED SELLS REED ADULT BOOKS UNITS.</title>
<headline>REED SELLS REED ADULT BOOKS UNITS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch publishing group Reed-Elsevier said on Friday it has agreed to sell the adult Trade division of Reed Books to publisher Random House.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details but said that it intends to sell the rest of Reed Books -- which comprises the divisions of Children's, Illustrated and Reference -- in due course.</p>
</text>
